  + Syndicated Loan Facility Schedule : Schedule
  + Syndicated Loan Facility Status : Status
  + Syndicated Loan Facility Currency : CurrencyCode
  + Syndicated Loan Facility Regulation Reference : Regulation
  + Syndicated Loan Facility Regulation Type : RuleSetTypeValues
  + Syndicated Loan Facility Jurisdiction : Jurisdiction
  + Syndicated Loan Facility Booking Location : Text
